# vtium's terminfo entry xterm-vtium has the alias vtium, and tic writes
# the alias as a hard link to the entry in another directory. namcap reports
# a hard link across directories as an error, because it breaks when the two
# directories lie on different filesystems; both lie under
# /usr/share/terminfo, which is one directory tree on one filesystem.
Cross-directory hardlink in package \(usr/share/terminfo/x/xterm-vtium, usr/share/terminfo/v/vtium\)$
